   "prompt": "(a) $X\\sim$ Binomial$(10,\\,0.3)$: find $E[X]$ and $\\operatorname{Var}(X)$. (b) $X\\sim$ Uniform$(2,8)$: find $\\operatorname{Var}(X)$ and $\\sigma_X$. (c) $X\\sim$ Poisson$(3)$: find $E[(X-1)^2]$.",
